  "description": "JUNTOS Electric Bike FeaturesIntroducing the GOBIKE JUNTOS, our step-through foldable dual-passenger e-bike. This bike has plenty of power and is perfect for carrying a friend or loved one. We designed JUNTOS to easily carry one or two adult riders and travel up to 110 miles when you add the optional, secondary 17.4Ah battery. The JUNTOS comes standard with a 750w rear hub motor, 11.6Ah primary battery, 7-speed gearing assisted by the Shimano Altus derailleur, a front storage basket, rear storage rack, 20” x 4” Kenda off-road tires, front and rear fenders, and an oversized headlight. We’ve styled it beautifully with seamless welding, an integrated battery, and five amazing colors.The JUNTOS has it all to bring us TOGETHER!Juntos has a low step-through frame for easy access and mounting. This e-bike is foldable for easy storage and transportation. LCD Display The backlit LCD display is your communication center. Here, you will find your speed, power assist (PAS) level, battery level, and odometer. This multifunctional display is weather resistant and includes a USB charging port Speed Shifter We’ve designed our bikes to get you to your destination, no matter how difficult it is. The Shimano 7-speed shifter delivers smooth and reliable shifting performance that allows you to traverse all kinds of terrain. Choose the right gear then add pedal assist and you will blast your way up even the steepest hills. Motor Power JUNTOS is designed for two adult riders so we’ve paired the Juntos with a powerful 750W (900W Peak) motor to easily transport you and your passenger to your destination. Battery JUNTOS was engineered for distance. The primary 11.6Ah battery is integrated into the frame and can deliver up to 45 miles with pedal assist. If you need more range, simply add a secondary 17.4Ah battery under the seat and get over 100 miles with pedal assist. Accessories JUNTOS comes standard equipped with the Shimano Altus Derailleur, Shimano 6-speed gearing, and thumb throttle. Also included are front and rear fenders, front suspension, headlight, tail light, two-passenger seat, and rear cargo rack.",
